# Skip `lib/views/dummy/`

Always ignore this folder.

- Do not read, search, cite, import, edit, or delete files under `lib/views/dummy/`.
- Do not copy code from it into production screens.
- Production code lives in `lib/views/screens/` and `lib/views/base/`.
